WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.473
Shopping across different stores gets messy fast.

00:00:03.473 --> 00:00:05.184
COMPR keeps it simple.

00:00:05.184 --> 00:00:11.565
Open the extension to review the detected price, sizes and product details.

00:00:11.565 --> 00:00:14.092
Save the item, then keep shopping.

00:00:14.092 --> 00:00:18.039
Your saved products come together in one clear shortlist.

00:00:18.039 --> 00:00:23.973
Search, filter and compare without switching between tabs.

00:00:23.973 --> 00:00:28.236
Found your favourite? Return to the original product page.

00:00:28.236 --> 00:00:33.868
COMPR is free, requires no account and stores products locally in your browser.
